have faded yellow♪

176
00:14:08,620 --> 00:14:09,420
Ms. Song.

177
00:14:09,820 --> 00:14:11,100
Please don't go, alright?

178
00:14:12,780 --> 00:14:14,100
Let's go home.

179
00:14:15,990 --> 00:14:20,210
♪The wind is cold,
