194
00:15:20,260 --> 00:15:23,060
♪One gunshot echoes through half a life♪

195
00:15:23,060 --> 00:15:23,860
Jin Keke!

196
00:15:25,420 --> 00:15:27,060
I know you're up there! Get down here!

197
00:15:28,780 --> 00:15:30,100
Who dares touch my daughter?

198
00:15:31,340 --> 00:15:33,260
